## YOUR TASK

Generate @task methods for ERROR scenarios (expect 400/422/404).

### RULES

1. Each @task tests ONE validation failure
2. Use weights: @task(3) for common errors, @task(1) for edge cases
3. Use `expect_error()` helper - it handles error assertions
4. Name tasks: `{action}_{resource}_{error_type}()`

